@startuml US1

participant User
participant Browser
participant Model
participant Database

User -> Browser : Request new account, select role type, submit credentials
Browser -> Model : Submit registration details
Model -> Database : Query credentials
alt credentials exists
    Database -> Model : Return error (user exists)
    Model -> User : Display error message, redirect to sign in
else credentials do not exist
    Database -> Model : Store new user credentials
    Model -> User : Display success message, send to main page
end




@enduml